abstract: >-
  Analysis code, derived analytical data sets and fitted result objects
  reproducing every value reported in a study of morphological change in 73
  Atlantic Forest passerine species across 24 years (1995-2018) of regional
  warming, using ATLANTIC BIRD TRAITS. Code is MIT licensed; data, results and
  text are CC BY 4.0. See LICENSE and LICENSE-DATA.md.
keywords:
  - body size
  - climate change
  - phenotypic variation
  - macroecology
  - Atlantic Forest
  - phylogenetic comparative analysis
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: 'https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/esalves/atlantic_birds'
